# Before working on FlockStack

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root: how the app is organized, FlockStack Cloud and self-hosting, the open source boundary, naming, code style and tests.

In FlockStack Cloud's own repository, `AGENTS.cloud.md` is next to it: read it too, for what stays private, the sync to the open source, deploys and worktrees.
